.SH "NAME"
roark\-metric\-variant\-delete \- Delete a metric variant
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark metric variant delete
\fIid\-or\-slug\fR \fIvariant\-id\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Remove one of your organization’s variants. Anything pinned to it falls back to the Default, so deleting a fork of a Roark variant returns you to Roark’s configuration. Roark’s own variants cannot be deleted, and neither can a Default. Values already collected under the deleted variant are retained.
.SH "API"
